Package: FrenchElectionAnalysis
Title: Changing Electoral Coalitions of the French Left (1988-2022)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Logan", "Summerlin", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reproducible pipeline that builds a two-tier dataset linking French
    presidential election results (commune and bureau-de-vote level) to INSEE
    census and income data, for analyzing the socioeconomic composition of the
    French Left vote across the last seven presidential elections.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
